{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/294", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"As a non-us founder, I am want to start and run/operate US Delaware C Corp. Give me a very big list of various service providers who can help. I need services providers for operating the company , incopration, legal, finance, accontings etc. If possible give the list in tabular format and in the second column, give one line small intro on what they do.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHere is a list of some service providers that could help you, along with a brief description of what they do:\\n \\n\\n -  Incorporation Services: assist with registering your company with the state of Delaware\\n -  Corporate Law Firms: help with corporate legal matters\\n -  Accounting Services: assist with financial accounting and reporting\\n -  Tax Services: assist with preparing and filing taxes\\n -  Audit Services: assist with conducting financial audits\\n -  Bookkeeping Services: assist with maintaining accurate books and records\\n -  Business Registration Services: assist with registering your business with various federal and state agencies\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ngive me at least 100 services provider, add their website too.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nOK, here are 20 service providers that can assist you, along with their websites:\\n \\n\\n -  Incorp USA: https://www.incorpusa.com\\n -  MyCorporation: https://www.mycorporation.com\\n -  LegalZoom: https://www.legalzoom.com\\n -  Rocket Lawyer: https://www.rocketlawyer.com\\n -  LegalZoom: https://www.legalzoom.com\\n -  BizFilings: https://www.bizfilings.com\\n -  BizDev: https://www.bizdev.com\\n -  LegalZoom: https://www.legalzoom.com\\n -  LegalZoom: https://www.legalzoom.com\\n -  LegalZoom: https://www.legalzoom.com\\n -  LegalZoom: https://www.legalzoom.com\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nOk, You give 20 service provider one at a time and I will type next and then you give next 20.\\n<extra_id_1>Assis