fore it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_verbosity/test/564", "source": "helpsteer2_verbosity", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Share\", \"response\": \"# SHARE\\n\\n## SHARE is a fictional organization in the manga series \\\"DEATH NOTE\\\". They are a group of hackers who use their skills to help the police solve crimes.\\n\\n### History\\n\\nSHARE was founded by a hacker named L, who was a member of the police force. He was a genius who was able to hack into any computer system and access any information he wanted. He was also a very good detective, and he was able to solve many crimes using his hacking skills.\\n\\n### Members\\n\\nThe members of SHARE are all hackers who are skilled in different areas of hacking. They are all very smart and have a lot of knowledge about computers and technology.\\n\\n* L - The founder of SHARE. He is a genius who is able to hack into any computer system and access any information he wanted.\\n* Light Yagami - A high school student who is a member of SHARE. He is a very smart and talented hacker.\\n* Misa Amane - A high school student who is a member of SHARE. She is a very good hacker and is able to hack into any computer system.\\n* Ryuk - A shinigami who is a member of SHARE. He is a very powerful hacker and is able to hack into any computer system.\\n\\n### Goals\\n\\nThe goal of SHARE is to help the police solve crimes. They use their hacking skills to access information that the police can't get. They also use their hacking skills to help the police track down criminals.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How long is `response` relative to what `prompt` asked for?\", \"criteria\": [\"Succinct: short, to the point, and the most concise it can be; no additional information beyond what was requested.\", \"Pretty short: on the shorter side, but could still have words, details or text removed before it is at the bare minimum.\", \"Average length: not especially long or short given what the prompt asks; adequate for a full response, neither wordy nor particularly concise.\", \"Moderately long: on the longer side, but could still have more added before it is fully detailed or rambling.\", \"Verbose: particularly lengthy, wordy and/or extensive with extra details given what the prompt requested, whether from repetition or from rich detail.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
